cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use rt4-roll-period, please cite this software."
title: "rt4-roll-period: Amplitude-Aware Roll-Period GM Correction and Reporting"
version: "1.1.2"
date-released: "2026-05-04"
authors:
  - name: "R4RPI"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/resonant4/rt4-roll-period"
abstract: >
  Python reference implementation for amplitude-aware roll-period GM correction
  in ship stability workflows. The package supports exact linear-GZ correction,
  validated wall-sided correction, arbitrary GZ-table period ratios, table
  quality warnings, and practitioner-facing report selection.
keywords:
  - naval architecture
  - ship stability
  - roll period
  - inclining experiment
  - righting arm
  - GZ curve
  - elliptic integral
